'''Bad Guys''' (悪に染まりし者達, ''Aku ni Somarishi Mono Tachi'', '''Those Absorbed in Darkness''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (L): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 79 frames (2.63 sec).

